    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>MKWebTech Conversion Blocks provides lightweight, conversion-focused Gutenberg<br />\nblocks. It does not depend on a page builder or jQuery.</p>\n<p>The Countdown Timer block supports fixed-date and evergreen countdowns,<br />\nresponsive templates, optional headings and buttons, and configurable expiry<br />\nactions.</p>\n<p>The Sticky Notification Bar block supports rich messages, calls to action,<br />\nresponsive visibility, reusable templates, optional icons, audience visibility,<br />\ndismissal, and timed auto-hide behavior.</p>\n<p>The Promo Banner block supports rich promotional content, primary and secondary<br />\ncalls to action, responsive layouts, background media, overlays, and reusable<br />\nvisual templates.</p>\n<p>The Floating CTA block supports fixed viewport positioning, accessible link<br />\nsettings, optional icons, device visibility, configurable offsets, and<br />\nreduced-motion-aware entrance animations.</p>\n<p>Global settings provide modular behavior, design, performance, and<br />\naccessibility defaults, plus import, export, reset, and cache tools.</p>\n<p>The built-in pattern library provides ready-made sales, launch, engagement, and<br />\nproduct marketing sections composed from the included blocks.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>mkwebtech-conversion-blocks</code> directory to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate MKWebTech Conversion Blocks through the Plugins screen in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20plugin%20require%20a%20page%20builder%3F\">\nDoes this plugin require a page builder?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. It is designed exclusively for the WordPress Block Editor.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"which%20conversion%20blocks%20are%20included%3F\">\nWhich conversion blocks are included?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The current version includes the Countdown Timer, Sticky Notification Bar,<br />\nPromo Banner, and Floating CTA blocks.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added the initial plugin architecture.</li>\n<li>Added the Countdown Timer block.</li>\n<li>Added the Sticky Notification Bar block.</li>\n<li>Added the Promo Banner block.</li>\n<li>Added the Floating CTA block.</li>\n<li>Added the modular Global Settings framework and administration pages.</li>\n<li>Added the automatically registered Block Pattern Library.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Lightweight, Gutenberg-first conversion blocks for WordPress.",
    "description": "<p>MKWebTech Conversion Blocks provides lightweight, conversion-focused Gutenberg<br />\nblocks. It does not depend on a page builder or jQuery.</p>\n<p>The Countdown Timer block supports fixed-date and evergreen countdowns,<br />\nresponsive templates, optional headings and buttons, and configurable expiry<br />\nactions.</p>\n<p>The Sticky Notification Bar block supports rich messages, calls to action,<br />\nresponsive visibility, reusable templates, optional icons, audience visibility,<br />\ndismissal, and timed auto-hide behavior.</p>\n<p>The Promo Banner block supports rich promotional content, primary and secondary<br />\ncalls to action, responsive layouts, background media, overlays, and reusable<br />\nvisual templates.</p>\n<p>The Floating CTA block supports fixed viewport positioning, accessible link<br />\nsettings, optional icons, device visibility, configurable offsets, and<br />\nreduced-motion-aware entrance animations.</p>\n<p>Global settings provide modular behavior, design, performance, and<br />\naccessibility defaults, plus import, export, reset, and cache tools.</p>\n<p>The built-in pattern library provides ready-made sales, launch, engagement, and<br />\nproduct marketing sections composed from the included blocks.</p>\n",
